window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Ruin follows in the wake of Torrlond’s victorious army and the beasts its priests enslave, leaving no corner of Eormenlond untouched by the inferno of its war. Kingdoms and tribes line up on opposing sides as the conflict rages, rekindling ancient hatreds and avenging old wrongs. </p> <p>As Dayraven struggles to contain the vast power of his curse, he and Sequara confront the destruction of all they hold dear. To salvage their world, they must sacrifice what most makes it precious. </p> <p>With twists as wrenching as they are unexpected, <i>The Prophet of Edan </i>reveals the War of the Way’s culmination.</p>"; 
